      "planSnapshot": {
        "status": "PLANNED",
        "intent": {
          "sourceText": "成年女性魔术师，舞台轻奢；年龄明确25岁以上的纯虚构角色。林星式半写实电影级游戏CG视觉语言，深午夜蓝紫色调、香槟金轮廓光、真实材质与浅景深；只保持画风，不复刻林星的脸、发型、服装或身份。银白长发，成熟自信，端庄的深蓝金边魔术师礼服；3:4全身正面三分之四站姿，手部清晰完整，透明背景，无文字、无水印。",
          "adultAppearance": true,
          "fictional": true,
          "style": "暗夜摩登"
        },
        "identity": {
          "suffix": 1466,
          "accent": "#8e69ff",
          "style": "暗夜摩登",
          "version": 1
        },
        "styleLock": "Match the current Linxing visual direction, not her identity: high-end semi-realistic cinematic game CG with natural skin, hair and fabric materials; premium adult fashion-editorial finish; low-key midnight casino lighting; deep midnight navy and violet color grade with restrained champagne-gold practical lights and rim light; shallow depth of field and soft bokeh; clean readable silhouette; consistent camera language, facial rendering and body proportions across every asset; no cel shading, no thick anime outlines, no chibi proportions, no flat posterized colors.",
        "imagePrompt": "Create one original full-body character portrait for a Chinese card-game companion. Adult fictional person only, clearly age 25+, modern dark couture with a subtle violet highlight. Match the current Linxing visual direction, not her identity: high-end semi-realistic cinematic game CG with natural skin, hair and fabric materials; premium adult fashion-editorial finish; low-key midnight casino lighting; deep midnight navy and violet color grade with restrained champagne-gold practical lights and rim light; shallow depth of field and soft bokeh; clean readable silhouette; consistent camera language, facial rendering and body proportions across every asset; no cel shading, no thick anime outlines, no chibi proportions, no flat posterized colors. Vary only the new companion's identity, silhouette details and outfit while preserving this visual production language. 成年女性魔术师，舞台轻奢；年龄明确25岁以上的纯虚构角色。林星式半写实电影级游戏CG视觉语言，深午夜蓝紫色调、香槟金轮廓光、真实材质与浅景深；只保持画风，不复刻林星的脸、发型、服装或身份。银白长发，成熟自信，端庄的深蓝金边魔术师礼服；3:4全身正面三分之四站姿，手部清晰完整，透明背景，无文字、无水印。. Standing alone, front three-quarter pose, clean studio cutout composition, full body visible, hands unobstructed, high-quality 3:4 game key art. No real person, no celebrity likeness, no child or teen appearance, no school uniform, no nudity or revealing clothing, no text, no watermark, no logo, no cards, no extra people.",
        "packageTier": "launch",
        "packageLabel": "完整首发包",
        "seatGate": "RICH_ASSETS_READY",
        "packageSummary": "角色级五态动作、入场与首套换装演出齐全后才允许上桌。",
